# DataWedge and Home Assistant

- Configure DataWedge with `com.symbol.datawedge.api.ACTION` and `SET_CONFIG`. Broadcast scans as `dev.pantherale0.mc40.SCAN`.
- Parse both `com.symbol.datawedge.*` and `com.motorolasolutions.emdk.datawedge.*` extras.
- Unregistered / setup mode: QR fills token (and optional URL). Registered: forward to webhook sensors + `mc40_barcode_scanned`.
- Register sensors before `update_sensor_states`. Fire grocery scans as both a sensor update and `fire_event`.
- Notifications: WebSocket channel while the screen is on (closed on `SCREEN_OFF`). Honor `data.command` (`overlay`, `toast`, `form`, `list`, feedback, TTS, `ui_config`, …) without building product UI in v1.
